na. Its products include intelligent tire sensing SoCs, BMS SoCs, wBMS SoCs, USI SoCs, and USS SoCs. It also offers sensor SoC platform that integrates sensing, processing and wireless transmission capabilities; wireless radio frequency technologies; automotive-grade capabilities; and engineering capabilities. The company products are used in applications, such as telecommunications, energy storage, automotive, industrial electronics, and robotics. SENASIC Electronics Technology Co., Ltd. was formerly known as Nanjing Yingruichuang Electronics Co., Ltd. SENASIC Electronics Technology Co., Ltd. was founded in 2015 and is based in Shanghai, China.","description_en":"SENASIC Electronics Technology Co., Ltd., through its subsidiaries, engages in design, research and development, and sales of chip products in China. Its products include intelligent tire sensing SoCs, BMS SoCs, wBMS SoCs, USI SoCs, and USS SoCs. It also offers sensor SoC platform that integrates sensing, processing and wireless transmission capabilities; wireless radio frequency technologies; automotive-grade capabilities; and engineering capabilities. The company products are used in applications, such as telecommunications, energy storage, automotive, industrial electronics, and robotics. SENASIC Electronics Technology Co., Ltd. was formerly known as Nanjing Yingruichuang Electronics Co., Ltd. SENASIC Electronics Technology Co., Ltd. was founded in 2015 and is based in Shanghai, China.","description_zh":"森納斯電子科技股份有限公司透過其子公司，在中國從事晶片產品的設計、研發和銷售。其產品包括智慧輪胎感測系統單晶片、電池管理系統單晶片、無線電池管理系統單晶片、通用感測器介面系統單晶片和超聲波感測器系統單晶片。該公司還提供整合感測、處理和無線傳輸能力的感測器系統單晶片平台；無線射頻技術；汽車級能力；以及工程能力。該公司的產品應用於電信、儲能、汽車、工業電子和機器人等領域。森納斯電子科技股份有限公司前身為南京英銳創電子有限公司。森納斯電子科技股份有限公司成立於二零一五年，總部位於中國上海。","address":"Building 10","city":"Shanghai","state":"SH","zip":"201210","country":"CN","phone":null,"full_address":"Building 10, Shanghai, SH, 201210, CN","year_high":45.48,"year_low":11.8,"range_52w":"11.8-45.48","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_own